msgstr "强生创新JLABS上海"

#: ../../entities/jlabs.rst:6
msgid "Corporate program | Pudong | Research checked 2026-11-04"
msgstr "企业创新计划｜浦东新区｜资料核查日期 2026-11-04"

#: ../../entities/jlabs.rst:8
msgid "AI and industry focus: Health, AI for Science."
msgstr "AI及产业方向：健康、科学智能。"

#: ../../entities/jlabs.rst:10
msgid ""
"An operator-listed life-sciences incubation site in Zhangjiang with an "
"application route. For AI-enabled healthcare, clarify scientific fit, "
"laboratory requirements, residency pricing, IP and any separate challenge "
"or investment terms."
msgstr "运营方公布的张江生命科学孵化基地，设有申请渠道。AI医疗团队应确认研究方向、实验需求、入驻费用和知识产权安排；挑战赛或投资项目另有条件。"

#: ../../entities/jlabs.rst:12
msgid ""
"`Evidence S070 "
"<https://jnjinnovation.com/locations/jlabs/jlabs-shanghai>`_. Incubator "
"For Life Science Start-Ups, Shanghai, China | JLABS | Johnson & Johnson "
"Innovation."
msgstr "`资料来源 S070 <https://jnjinnovation.com/locations/jlabs/jlabs-shanghai>`_. Incubator For Life Science Start-Ups, Shanghai, China | JLABS | Johnson & Johnson Innovation."

#: ../../entities/jlabs.rst:14
msgid "Status and support"
msgstr "项目状态与支持内容"

#: ../../entities/jlabs.rst:17
msgid "Published entity; intake to confirm"
msgstr "机构信息已核实，当前是否接受申请需确认"

#: ../../entities/jlabs.rst:19
msgid ""
"No standard cash award, fee waiver or equity percentage is verified for "
"this entry. Request the current written offer."
msgstr "尚未确认统一的现金资助额度、费用减免或股权比例，请向运营机构索取最新书面方案。"

#: ../../entities/jlabs.rst:21
msgid "Contact and location"
msgstr "联系方式与地址"

#: ../../entities/jlabs.rst:24
msgid ""
"`Official website / intake route "
"<https://jnjinnovation.com/locations/jlabs/jlabs-shanghai>`_"
msgstr "`官网及申请渠道 <https://jnjinnovation.com/locations/jlabs/jlabs-shanghai>`_"

#: ../../entities/jlabs.rst:26
msgid ""
"Use the official website to request the responsible team and current "
"application route. Email addresses are not reproduced in this publication."
msgstr "请通过官网咨询具体负责部门及最新申请方式。本图谱不公开电子邮箱地址。"

#: ../../entities/jlabs.rst:28
msgid ""
"Map position uses a district or campus anchor; it is not a verified "
"office location."
msgstr "地图采用行政区或校区参考点，不代表已核实的办公地址。"

#: ../../entities/jlabs.rst:30
msgid "Application workflow"
msgstr "申请流程"

#: ../../entities/jlabs.rst:33
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "以下步骤为本书整理的申请参考，实际办理流程以最新官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../entities/jlabs.rst:35
msgid "Identify the corporate business owner and one measurable use case."
msgstr "找到企业业务负责人，明确可量化的应用需求。"

#: ../../entities/jlabs.rst:37
msgid ""
"Submit the product brief, pilot evidence and relevant technical "
"requirements."
msgstr "提交产品简介、试点结果及相关技术要求。"

#: ../../entities/jlabs.rst:39
msgid ""
"Confirm cohort availability or agree a scoped pilot, data rights and IP "
"terms."
msgstr "确认项目是否正在征集，或另行约定试点范围、数据权属和知识产权。"

#: ../../entities/jlabs.rst:41
msgid ""
"Review procurement, payment, acceptance and the production decision "
"separately."
msgstr "分别确认采购、付款、验收流程，以及转为正式部署的决策条件。"

